class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}commutator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf R)\\land\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf R)\n\\to[\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf R}=\\theta\\cap\\psi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}commutator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf R)\\land\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf R)\n\\to[\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf R}=\\theta\\cap\\psi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Every lattice expansion has a majority term and hence lies in a congruence-distributive variety. For such algebras the term-condition commutator is the meet of the two congruences.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-residuated-commutator-thm-residuated-commutator","text":"thm-residuated-commutator `thm-residuated-commutator`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-residuated","status":"resolved","id":"69fd12190649a7f7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-residuated]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-commutator]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf R}$ is the term-condition commutator of [[93-df-commutator]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf R)","display":false},{"tex":"[\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}commutator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf R)\\land\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf R)\n\\to[\\theta,\\psi]_{\\mathbf R}=\\theta\\cap\\psi","display":true}],"bytes":903,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["69fd12190649a7f7","18ca772ab524a46f","30b341bfbd8b5301"]}